--- design (v0/v2 simplifications, paper-faithful version is v1.x) ---
- SINGLE-HEAD attention (D=384 dim) rather than 6-head × 64. Compute-equivalent
  total MACs; multi-head v1 changes softmax math not resource shape.
- No LayerNorm, no residual connections (v0 baseline).
- Shifted-linear softmax approx (same pattern T0022/T0024/T0026).
- 7 sequential stages:
    1. QKV projection (x · W_qkv → qkv[256][1152])
    2. Scores = Q · K^T  ([256][256] int16)
    3. Softmax (max, shift, sum, normalize)
    4. ATTN_O = attn_w · V (chunked-c-tile pattern from T0026)
    5. Output projection (attn_o · W_out → mha_out)
    6. FFN1 + ReLU (mha_out · W_ffn1 → ffn_h)
    7. FFN2 (ffn_h · W_ffn2 → out)
- K_UR=64 unroll on inner k-loop, j-loop PIPELINE II=1.

